{"title":"The Sword Emperor’s Path To Namgung","synopsis":"Dari author yang sama yang mengerjakan \\<Mount Hua Sect’s Genius Phantom Swordsman> dan studio yang mengerjakan \\<The Regressed Mercenary’s Machinations>.\n\n“Apa penyesalan adalah hal terakhir yang tersisa di atas pedang?”\n\nNam Young-shin, Sword Emperor yang kehilangan segalanya sebagai harga untuk menghentikan Sekte Sun-Moon Demonic.\n\nDi ambang kematian, ia menghadapi kehidupan baru dengan nama Namgung Jun.","alternative_title":"검제가 남궁세가를 세우는 법","author":"Muhyang","artist":"Park JinSeok","genres":["Action","Demon","Martial Arts","Murim"],"chapters":[{"id":"f645ca75-a4a4-4ab9-b591-d09be4703f2c","number":"20","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"5cec8c68-7b9b-4cef-8e6e-f6b31b648bc7","number":"19","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-07-26","images":[]},{"id":"b46c078d-1d55-4401-839b-7bf1923a22b5","number":"18","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"id":"3c5135a8-3a73-4fde-b5d5-7f58a8263f3b","number":"17","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"4705d41e-d0fb-4b73-94d6-9e5188960cc4","number":"16","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"id":"dd4c6161-47aa-4670-a3d0-ca75c6d6c95d","number":"15","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"id":"eee9fac6-e3b7-4dd8-b0c3-4a2aa66a2fdb","number":"14","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"8bc81ea1-991b-4079-9da5-2edc9f60fc86","number":"13","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"2f29f70a-32c6-4df1-b802-9577dcaaea99","number":"12","title":"Chapter 12","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"42a960ef-8365-4b27-a46b-09b4eb8713fb","number":"11","title":"Chapter 11","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"c2a27b07-38f4-4d39-9bc5-385e63795d61","number":"10","title":"Chapter 10","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"b74e4292-a9d1-489c-ac5d-dc163ff3df2d","number":"9","title":"Chapter 9","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"07b827f6-4ce9-45